{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117782","id":3437536739,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7M5KXj","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117782","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117782.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117782.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117782","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117782/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117782/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117782/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d35113aa9d138438146c61d66f3a52a40f66d124","number":117782,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add support for joypad button echo events","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11199\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the code in `Input` class to send joypad echo events for buttons\r\nThis PR adds 3 new project settings:\r\n- `input_devices/joypads/joypad_echo_events/send`: If `true`, the engine will send joypad echo events after the user has pressed the joypad buttons or moved the joypad axes for long enough, `false` by default for existing projects and `true` by default for newly created projects;\r\n- `input_devices/joypads/joypad_echo_events/wait_time`: The amount of time of pressing the joypad buttons or keeping the joypad axes over the deadzone required for the engine to start sending echo events, in seconds, `0.5` by default;\r\n- `input_devices/joypads/joypad_echo_events/count_per_second`: The number of times per second joypad echo events should be sent by the engine after the user has pressed the buttons or kept the axes over the deadzone for long enough, `20` by default;\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c392168-89eb-4720-8c00-a4b4a53098bf\r\n\r\nThis PR also works with high numbers of echo events per second that are set via `input_devices/joypads/joypad_echo_events/count_per_second`. Here I set it to `1000`, you can see that the counter increases by 1000 every second:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c19f7c8-a2b0-4844-9151-2a7f924f9b53\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] `InputEventJoypadButton.is_echo()` + `ProjectSettings.input_devices/joypads/send_joypad_echo_events`\r\n- [x] `ProjectSettings.input_devices/joypads/joypad_echo_events_wait_time`\r\n- [x] `ProjectSettings.input_devices/joypads/joypad_echo_events_count_per_second`\r\n- [x] Run `Input::_process()` in the main/rendering step instead of the physics step\r\n- [x] Try to add echo events for axes\r\n- [x] Godot Docs PR ( https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/11950 )\r\n- [x] Enable `ProjectSettings.input_devices/joypads/send_joypad_echo_events` by default for new projects?\r\n- [ ] Modify `Tree` and `OptionButton` classes to properly react to these events","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id